<title>LITHUANIA: HERMIS REGISTERS 20 MILLION LITAS BLOCK TRADE.</title>
<headline>HERMIS REGISTERS 20 MILLION LITAS BLOCK TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's stock exchange said on Friday that a 20 million litas deal with Hermis Bank shares was registerd and 84,620 ordinary shares changed hands.</p>
<p>The bourse also said that the prices for the deal ranged from 176.30 litas to 272 litas.</p>
<p>Dealers said 4.7 percent of Hermis Bank shares changed hands but could not say who bought the stake.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
